        {
            "title": "川普提名的Brett Matsumoto獲參議院確認 將出任美國勞工統計局局長",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"Photographer: Tierney L. Cross/Bloomberg\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ed89955fa0857e649da025a3bb2e2f5bfa203b47ac09f9241506ba835356938a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fbloomberg_chinese_traditional_757%2F9127d5f992e89f752b172b4569f62e57\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">Photographer: Tierney L. Cross/Bloomberg</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 美國參議院確認Brett <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/Matsumoto\" rel=\"\">Matsumoto</a>出任<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":0,\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\",\"ySubModuleName\":\"anchor_text\"}' data-ylk=\"elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;subsec:anchor_text;\" href=\"https://hk.news.yahoo.com/tag/美國勞工統計局\" rel=\"\">美國勞工統計局</a>局長。川普去年突然解雇前任局長後，這一關鍵職位如今終於得到填補。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">參議院周五以51票贊成、47票反對確認了一批提名，其中包括Matsumoto。此前，參議院衛生、教育、勞工和養老金委員會舉行了提名聽證會，並於7月15日按黨派立場表決通過Matsumoto的提名，將其提交參議院全院審議。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"Brett Matsumoto攝影：Tierney L. Cross/ 彭博\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f22ff92234fb502b6ccc27ba9659e81af3aea55df9e6b4902ef631e3361afa61/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fno%2Fbloomberg_chinese_traditional_757%2Fcf3d08102e3ed1f926cb5da0c7d54b54\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">Brett Matsumoto攝影：Tierney L. Cross/ 彭博</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Matsumoto將領導這一負責發布美國就業和通膨報告的數據機構，任期四年；其發布的部分數據對全球金融市場影響重大。這個約有2,000名員工、強調自身獨立和無黨派立場的機構中，局長是唯一的政治任命官員。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-08c1aabe-7b9a-3645-a431-9fc9b9d99e08-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">這一聲譽去年8月受到衝擊，當時川普解雇了時任局長Erika McEntarfer。川普在沒有提供證據的情況下聲稱，就業數據出於政治目的受到了操縱。McEntarfer遭解雇一事引發對未來政府數據質量和可信度的擔憂。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">推薦閱讀：川普提名的勞工統計局局長候選人承諾維護機構獨立性</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Matsumoto擁有經濟學博士學位，川普今年早些時候提名他執掌該機構。他2015年進入勞工統計局，在價格和指數研究部門工作，專長為通膨和消費測算。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">他還曾在川普兩屆政府期間任職於白宮經濟顧問委員會。勞工統計局資深官員William Wiatrowski在此期間任代理局長。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">推薦閱讀：缺人、缺錢、缺領導：美國勞工統計局如何守住非農數據的「黃金標準」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Trump's BLS Pick Brett Matsumoto Confirmed in Senate Vote</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">--聯合報導 Laura Davison.</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%B7%9D%E6%99%AE%E6%8F%90%E5%90%8D%E7%9A%84brett-matsumoto%E7%8D%B2%E5%8F%83%E8%AD%B0%E9%99%A2%E7%A2%BA%E8%AA%8D-%E5%B0%87%E5%87%BA%E4%BB%BB%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E5%8B%9E%E5%B7%A5%E7%B5%B1%E8%A8%88%E5%B1%80%E5%B1%80%E9%95%B7-195851032.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-08-08 05:18:45",
